# LSPR24 inputs. Not vendored -- 2.6 GB and 4.7 GB -- so fetch your own copies:
#
#   Locked Shields Partners Run 24 (LSPR24): A Next-Generation Cybersecurity
#   Dataset for Blue Team Automation
#   https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14900873          licensed CC0
#
# These are the publisher's own MD5 sums, copied from the Zenodo record rather
# than computed here, so verifying is a check against the source of truth and
# not against whatever happened to be on one laptop. Everything else in this
# directory claims to regenerate from these files; a different revision of the
# dataset would regenerate something different and say nothing about it, which
# is what the pin exists to catch.
#
#   make verify-inputs      or      md5sum -c INPUTS.md5
#
# The record carries two further files this example does not use:
#   eve.log                145,368,223 B  7706badbf6f5759be544d7bcaabcd235
#   attack_narratives.json  11,275,823 B  4d9be4a2aea86b425dadcb446440752b
a407011e9edbe615ce58a1e625c0a340  lspr24_v2.parquet
46c4dd79e90ee26d40736996b52abd91  ossec-archive-host-logs.json
